    "turn_text": "Well, thank you so much for taking a few minutes to talk with us today. I know you have some, you're working on a bill right now that has to do with a lot of, a lot of people who are listening right now, and that is the rural community and rural renewable energy. It's been a topic and you're addressing that now. Tell us, tell us about what you've been working on here.",
